          "title": "AI Weekly, summarising Bloomberg: Tekever closes $580m Series D at $6.4bn",
          "url": "https://aiweekly.co/alerts/tekever-closes-580m-series-d-at-64b-eyes-defense-ma",
          "date": "2026-09-23"
